<section image-layout="blank" id="wx8unRoXf8"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="_liX07F-32" padding="0" colspan="18"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/HCGpgWucQnwHcu5Ur8mE7.png" saved-media-id="av1cpyr7i1emopa" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="restorative-hospitality-editorial" alt="Quiet editorial hospitality photograph in a boutique hotel library lounge, partial figure seated near a window with hands resting beside a journal, tea glass and folded towel, natural morning light, crisp white surfaces, sea-glass accents and deep teal shadows, observed rather than posed, no text or logos" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="TdJRWbkCSe" vertical-align="center" colspan="42"><h2>The 60-minute guest ritual</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>One disciplined spine; each property’s setting and practice add character.</b></p><grid divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-style="subtle" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" direction="vertical" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 30pt; --marker-gap: 12pt;"><grid-item id="KTzcjLNeP7" padding="5pt 0"><h4>0–5 min · Welcome</h4><p font-size="16pt">Personal greeting, orientation, and a simple choice of pace or position.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Kyqp6jMViC" padding="5pt 0"><h4>5–15 min · Arrive</h4><p font-size="16pt">Breath, mobility, or grounding—by qualified practitioners, within scope.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="uVTRTHpiZ1" padding="5pt 0"><h4>15–40 min · Restore</h4><p font-size="16pt">Guided stretching, sound, quiet movement, or seated relaxation.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="uLpxFyzmsr" padding="5pt 0"><h4>40–55 min · Linger</h4><p font-size="16pt">Tea, water, journaling, or silence tied to place and time of day.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Q5clpnJFJq" padding="5pt 0"><h4>55–60 min · Close</h4><p font-size="16pt">A clear ending, optional takeaway, and warm return to the stay.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>